feat: rewrite as Electron desktop app (Imprint)

Complete rewrite from CLI skill to Electron desktop application.
Extracts UI design styles from any URL and exports as CSS/Tailwind
themes for AI consumption.

- Electron 34 + Forge + Vite + React 19 + TypeScript
- Playwright-based headless style extraction (code-first, zero tokens)
- SQLite local storage, multi-format export (CSS/Tailwind/JSON/MD)
- Built-in themes with live skinning and template demos
- i18n support (zh-CN / en)
- AI config: API Key (9 providers) or local Agent CLI detection
- ESLint, Prettier, Commitlint, Husky, GitHub Actions PR check
- pnpm package manager with hoisted node-linker for Electron
